{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011YnkYBSnFgXHsnDFWC1dzV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — Phase-Gated Compound Sparsity\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 (数值对齐 n=500 registry: DS median_diff 0.39/1.21/3.99/8.48; QW 0.07/0.31/1.07/3.16; Cohen's d registry 0.61→1.13/0.37→1.44; C7+C10 status→confirmed; imp/rand 2.7-15×) | 维护者: Director\n4\t\n5\t## Core Insight\n6\t\n7\tCompound sparsity（attention head pruning + KV cache eviction）的 severity 不是固定常数——它是 eviction strategy 和 reasoning phase 交互的涌现属性。Importance-based eviction 的 compound interaction severity（paired median difference: median(II_low_i − II_high_i)）随 sparsity 单调递增（DeepSeek: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Qwen: 0.07→0.31→1.07→3.16），而 random masking 在 s015/s020 NS，在 s025 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance（DS: 0.257 vs 3.986; QW: 0.393 vs 1.074, 2.7-15×差异），存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025（D063; s030 待定）。Cohen's d（per-problem paired, B=10000）从 medium 到 large（DeepSeek: 0.61→1.13; Qwen: 0.37→1.44，registry cohens_d s015→s030）。LLaMA 跨架构验证（D060）qualitative direction consistent（within-importance d_z~1.0），但 strategy×phase 交互弱于 Qwen2 架构（imp_vs_rand d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 显著），且 random 在 LLaMA 上也显示显著 phase gradient（d_z 0.35→0.44），与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。GSM8K 跨 benchmark 验证（D075）：importance masking 的 phase gradient 在 GSM8K 上同样单调递增（QW: 0.039→0.158→1.100→2.092; DS: 0.241→0.740→1.992→4.682），但 strategy specificity（importance/random gradient ratio）从 MATH-500 的 15-36× 衰减至 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8×。注意：\"反转\"仅在原始 II_low 值上（random > importance），phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random。Strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 机制是开放问题（见 §6 Discussion）。这一发现挑战了 compound degradation 均匀分布的隐含假设。\n8\t\n9\t**数字基准**：所有数字基于 bf16 per-problem paired 统计量（B=10000 bootstrap）。median_diff 定义为 median(II_low_i − II_high_i)（逐 problem 配对差的中位数）。fp16 旧数据已弃用。\n10\t\n11\t## Narrative Arc\n12\t\n13\tCompound sparsity 是高效 LLM 推理的实用部署需求，但 prior work（SparK, Ada-KV, SLiM）将 compound interaction 视为均匀超可加。我们发现 severity 是 strategy × phase 交互的涌现属性：importance eviction 的 compound interaction 在 low-sparsity phase 远大于 high-sparsity phase（paired median difference 单调递增 0.39→8.48），而 random eviction 在低 sparsity (s015/s020) NS，在 s025+ 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance (2.7-15×)——存在 sparsity threshold (~s020-s025)，低于阈值 compound effect importance-specific，高于阈值两者均触发但 importance 主导。Cross-model replication 方向一致（Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek，onset threshold s≥0.20）。LLaMA 跨架构验证已完成（c3_llama, D060）：qualitative direction consistent（importance phase gradient d_z≈1.0），但 imp_vs_rand 交互弱（d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 显著），且 random 也显示非平凡 phase gradient（d_z 0.35→0.44），strategy-dependence 强度 architecture-dependent。我们通过 discrimination collapse 机制解释这一现象：head pruning → importance score 的判别力崩塌（Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致）→ importance eviction 退化为有偏伪随机。Attention entropy redistribution 作为 model-dependent secondary effect 在 DeepSeek 上观察到，但在 Qwen 上不稳健（D044）。\n14\t\n15\t**Framing 硬约束（D015）**：\n16\t- MUST: \\\\\\\"emergent phase-strategy interaction\\\\\\\"\n17\t- MUST NOT: \\\\\\\"importance metric limitation / importance is broken\\\\\\\"\n18\t- MUST NOT: claim \\\\\\\"importance masking produces super-additive interaction\\\\\\\" without qualifier — random masking also produces positive II, and at s025+ random is statistically significant (D063). The distinguishing signal is **magnitude gradient** (importance 2.7-15× larger) and **onset threshold** (random NS below ~s020, importance significant from s015+), not the existence of super-additivity itself (D023)\n19\t\n20\t## Core Claims\n21\t\n22\t| ID | Claim | Status | Key Evidence |\n23\t|----|-------|--------|-------------|\n24\t| C1 | Compound sparsity severity is strategy- and task-modulated | confirmed | MATH-500: importance gradient 15-36× random; GSM8K: ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。Phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random 跨 benchmark 成立，但 magnitude ratio task-dependent。Threshold ~s020-s025 (D063) |\n25\t| C2 | Severity is phase-modulated (amplified in low-sparsity phase) | confirmed | bf16 paired median difference 单调递增: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Bonferroni p<0.005 全 4 水平 (D032)。预注册：n=500 后若 QW s015 CI 仍跨零，叙事改为 'compound effect emerges above threshold sparsity (~s020)' |\n26\t| C3 | Phase-strategy crossover exists | confirmed | s=0.25: importance high_phase=0.032 < random=0.818, importance low_phase=7.196 > random=1.363 (bf16) |\n27\t| C4 | Discrimination collapse as primary mechanism; entropy redistribution model-dependent | partially_confirmed | D044: Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致; entropy collapse DeepSeek 一致但 Qwen s025 反转(+0.045) s030≈0。30/30 problems completed. |\n28\t| C5 | Phase-modulated compound severity generalizes across models | confirmed | DeepSeek + Qwen cross-model replication: 方向一致, Cohen's d ρ=1.0, gradient permutation p=0.043. Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek, onset threshold s≥0.20 (S3→C). |\n29\t| C5b | Phase-aware mitigation recovers compound degradation | future_work | D056: pilot 完成 gate_failed。Oracle recovery 18% < 30% gate (Wilcoxon p=0.002)，heuristic 32% 但 CI 跨零。方向正确但效应量不足，需更精细 phase boundary estimation → future work |\n30\t| C6 | Severity gradient is sub-exponential | confirmed | Growth rate decreasing: Δ增长因子 3.8×→4.8×→2.0×（递减） |\n31\t| C7 | Statistical power at n=500 confirms dose-response | confirmed | c2_n500_deepseek (success) + c2_qw_n500_r3 (success): 两模型 n=500 全 4 sparsity Bonferroni p<0.005, Spearman ρ=1.0 |\n32\t| C8 | Cross-architecture validation (LLaMA) | partially_confirmed | D060: within-importance phase gradient 强(d_z~1.0) ✓，但 imp_vs_rand 交互弱(d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 Bonferroni p=0.029 显著)。**关键**：random 在 LLaMA 上也显示显著 phase gradient(d_z 0.35→0.44, CI 排除零)，与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。Qualitative direction consistent, quantitative strategy×phase interaction weaker + architecture-dependent。论文禁用 \"confirms\"，改用 \"suggests\"/\"provides partial support\"。 |\n33\t| C9 | Differentiation from Lethe/SparK prior work | planned | Related Work §2 引用区分 + SparK gap analysis |\n34\t| S3→C | Onset threshold is model-dependent (DeepSeek s≥0.15, Qwen s≥0.20) | confirmed | D037/D038: Qwen s015 d_z=0.37 CI含0, s020+ 显著 |\n35\t| C10 | Phase gradient cross-benchmark robust; strategy specificity task-modulated | confirmed | GSM8K DS gradient 0.241→4.682 单调递增; QW gradient 0.039→2.092; imp/rand ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。QW random s025+s030 均 success |\n36\t| S7→C | Dose-response monotonicity (Spearman ρ=1.0) | confirmed | D047: 6-point dose-response, 单调递增 |\n37\t\n38\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n39\t\n40\t### RC1: Generalizability — 7B models only, benchmark scope\n41\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"Results on two 7B models and MATH-500 only. How do we know this generalizes to larger models or other reasoning tasks?\\\"\n42\t- **应对**: 四层泛化证据：(1) Cross-model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B + Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct（同架构不同训练，ρ=1.0）(2) Cross-architecture: c3_llama (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B, LlamaForCausalLM)，qualitative direction consistent，但需加限定——LLaMA 上 random 也显示 phase gradient，strategy × phase 交互弱于 Qwen2 架构（D060）(3) **Cross-benchmark (D075)**: GSM8K（两模型）phase gradient 单调递增复现（DS: 0.241→4.682; QW: 0.039→2.092），但 strategy specificity ratio 从 MATH-500 15-36× 衰减至 2.3-3.8×，表明 phase modulation 跨 benchmark 稳健而 magnitude modulation task-dependent。Limitations 诚实声明：(a) 7B scale only；(b) strategy specificity 强度 task-dependent（GSM8K 衰减，可能因推理链更短）；(c) LLaMA 跨架构验证 n=50 限制功效；(d) random phase gradient 行为 architecture-dependent。\n43\t- **实验支撑**: C5 (cross-model) + C8 (c3_llama cross-architecture) + C10 (cross-benchmark GSM8K, D075)\n44\t\n45\t### RC2: Mechanism — entropy-discrimination collapse 缺乏直接测量\n46\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"The mechanism is conceptual. Where is the empirical evidence for entropy increase and discrimination collapse?\\\"\n47\t- **应对**: c4_entropy 实验已完成（DeepSeek 30/30 + Qwen 30/30）。D044 结论：Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致（discrimination collapse confirmed）；entropy redistribution 在 DeepSeek 上一致但在 Qwen 上 s025 方向反转、s030 近零（model-dependent）。论文以 discrimination collapse 为主线，entropy 作 DeepSeek 特有的强化因素。\n48\t- **实验支撑**: c4_entropy (DeepSeek DONE) + qwen_c4_entropy (DONE, negative for entropy universality)\n49\t\n50\t### RC3: Practical impact — 没有 throughput 数据\n51\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"No wall-clock or throughput measurements. Is the severity amplification reflected in actual inference speed?\\\"\n52\t- **应对**: 本文定位是 empirical finding paper（发现 + 机制解释），不是 method paper。Throughput 不是 claim 的一部分。Discussion 中明确 phase-gated controller 作为 future direction。\n53\t  - C5b pilot 已完成（D056）：oracle recovery 18%（Wilcoxon p=0.002），heuristic recovery 32%（p=0.024），但两者 95% CI 均跨零。方向正确（Wilcoxon 显著）但效应量不足（未达 30% gate），需更精细的 phase boundary estimation。论文 §6 Discussion 诚实报告 pilot 结果 + future work。\n54\t  - Heuristic > oracle 悖论值得提及：token position ratio 粗粒度划分可能恰好更适合 mitigation 场景，暗示 phase boundary 的最优粒度是开放问题。\n55\t- **实验支撑**: c5b_pilot (gate_failed, D056)\n56\t\n57\t### RC4: Statistical rigor — bootstrap 是否足够\n58\t- **预期质疑**: \\\"Per-problem bootstrap with 50 problems — sufficient sample size?\\\"\n59\t- **应对**: bf16 使用 B=10000 per-problem paired bootstrap，有效配对数 n=49 (DeepSeek) / n=46 (Qwen)；n=500 实验进一步验证 (C7 running)。Permutation test 使用 paired median difference 作为 robust statistic（D032），Bonferroni 校正后全 4 水平 p<0.005。Dose-response 主用 Wilcoxon signed-rank p + median_diff（robust to outliers），Cohen's d 作为辅助效应量（DeepSeek 0.61→1.13, Qwen 0.37→1.44, registry cohens_d s015→s030），注释高 sparsity 下 d 受 outlier-driven variance 影响（DS s020→s025: median 3.3× jump 但 d 非单调，因极端 II 值影响分母，D064）。可在 appendix 补充 per-problem 分布图（已生成 fig4_per_problem_dist.pdf）。\n60\t- **实验支撑**: bf16 permutation test (D032) + Cohen's d per-problem paired (rebootstrap B=10000) + n=500 Wilcoxon (C7 running)\n61\t\n62\t### RC5: Novelty — prior work 是否已覆盖 phase-dependent sparsity\n63\t- **预期质疑**: \"ThinKV and phase-aware methods already consider phase. What's new?\"\n64\t- **应对**: Prior work 在单轴上分析 phase（ThinKV: phase-aware eviction）或 compound（SparK: joint compression）。没有工作同时分析 compound × phase × strategy 的三维交互。Crossover 现象（同一 strategy 在不同 phase 方向反转）是全新发现。Related Work 加 Lethe 引用区分 + SparK 对比。具体区分：\n65\t  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025): 在 KV cache 单轴上做 phase-aware 压缩（按 CoT 阶段差异化 eviction），但不涉及 pruning × eviction 的 compound interaction。我们研究的是双轴（head pruning × KV eviction）compound interaction 如何随 phase 变化，ThinKV 的单轴 phase-aware 策略是我们分析维度的子集。\n66\t  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026): 揭示了单轴 KV 压缩的 phase transition 和 representational rigidity，是机制层面最接近的工作。关键区分：他们刻画的是单一压缩轴上压缩率的 critical threshold（phase transition），我们刻画的是两种压缩方法的 compound interaction severity 如何被 reasoning phase 调制（phase-dependent gradient）——维度正交。\n67\t  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025): 发现 importance score collapse 并提出 entropy 补偿，为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供独立 supporting evidence——他们在单轴上观察到的 score collapse 正是我们在 compound setting 中发现的 Gini/CV 下降的单轴对应。\n68\t  - **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025): 针对 reasoning task 做 KV compression 优化，属于 task-specific method。我们不是提出新方法，而是 mechanistic 分析 compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 行为，二者目标不同（optimization vs understanding）。\n69\t- **实验支撑**: C3 (crossover), Related Work §2 的 gap 分析\n70\t\n71\t### RC6: Novelty vs Lethe/SparK\n72\t- **预期质疑**: \"How does this differ from Lethe (AAAI 2026) which also does layer-time-adaptive KV pruning, or SparK which studies compound compression?\"\n73\t- **应对**: Lethe 和 SparK 都没有分析 phase × strategy 的交互效应。Lethe 是 method paper（提出 adaptive eviction 方法），我们是 empirical finding paper（发现 phase-dependent severity gradient）。SparK 研究 compound compression 但将 interaction 视为均匀超可加，我们发现 interaction severity 随 phase 和 strategy 变化。新近工作进一步确认我们的独特定位：\n74\t  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026) 是最近的相关工作，研究单轴压缩的 phase transition 阈值行为。与我们的核心区别：他们的 phase transition 是压缩率维度上的 critical point，我们的 phase-dependent gradient 是 reasoning phase 维度上 compound interaction 的连续调制——两者刻画的 \"phase\" 语义不同（compression-rate phase vs reasoning phase）。\n75\t  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025) 和 **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025) 都在 KV compression 单轴上引入 phase/reasoning awareness，但均未涉及 compound interaction。我们的贡献在于揭示 pruning × eviction 双轴交互如何被 reasoning phase 调制，这是单轴方法无法观察到的涌现现象。\n76\t  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025) 的 importance score collapse 发现为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证，但 HIES 聚焦于单轴补偿方法，未研究 collapse 在 compound setting 中的放大效应。\n77\t  - Related Work §2 明确区分三者定位：Lethe/SparK = method/compound method, ThinKV/R-KV = single-axis phase-aware, Physics of KV = single-axis phase transition, HIES = single-axis collapse。我们 = compound × phase × strategy 三维交互分析。\n78\t- **实验支撑**: 不需要额外实验，仅需 §2 引用区分\n79\t\n80\t## Paper Positioning\n81\t\n82\t**类型**: Empirical finding paper（非 method paper）\n83\t**核心贡献**:\n84\t1. 发现 compound sparsity severity 的 strategy × phase 交互\n85\t2. 量化 severity gradient（bf16 paired median difference 0.39→8.48, Cohen's d 0.61→1.13）和 crossover 现象\n86\t3. 提出 discrimination collapse 机制解释（Gini/CV 跨模型一致；entropy redistribution model-dependent）\n87\t4. Cross-model + cross-architecture (LLaMA) replication 验证泛化性（三模型两架构；LLaMA partially_confirmed，strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent, D060）\n88\t\n89\t**投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR, deadline 2026-05-25\n90\t**Rebuttal 准备**: Day 9 (2026-05-23) 预留 rebuttal letter 写作时间\n91\t**关键时间线**：\n92\t- Day 9 (2026-05-23): 预留写 rebuttal letter\n93\t- Day 11 (2026-05-25): EMNLP 2026 ARR 截稿\n94\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d3a6356-38e1-41d0-9b56-a15a708917d3","uuid":"16f8b7b3-2ffc-4607-b57b-932b980e7dc4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:01:44.031Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073742/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — Phase-Gated Compound Sparsity\n\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 (数值对齐 n=500 registry: DS median_diff 0.39/1.21/3.99/8.48; QW 0.07/0.31/1.07/3.16; Cohen's d registry 0.61→1.13/0.37→1.44; C7+C10 status→confirmed; imp/rand 2.7-15×) | 维护者: Director\n\n## Core Insight\n\nCompound sparsity（attention head pruning + KV cache eviction）的 severity 不是固定常数——它是 eviction strategy 和 reasoning phase 交互的涌现属性。Importance-based eviction 的 compound interaction severity（paired median difference: median(II_low_i − II_high_i)）随 sparsity 单调递增（DeepSeek: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Qwen: 0.07→0.31→1.07→3.16），而 random masking 在 s015/s020 NS，在 s025 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance（DS: 0.257 vs 3.986; QW: 0.393 vs 1.074, 2.7-15×差异），存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025（D063; s030 待定）。Cohen's d（per-problem paired, B=10000）从 medium 到 large（DeepSeek: 0.61→1.13; Qwen: 0.37→1.44，registry cohens_d s015→s030）。LLaMA 跨架构验证（D060）qualitative direction consistent（within-importance d_z~1.0），但 strategy×phase 交互弱于 Qwen2 架构（imp_vs_rand d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 显著），且 random 在 LLaMA 上也显示显著 phase gradient（d_z 0.35→0.44），与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。GSM8K 跨 benchmark 验证（D075）：importance masking 的 phase gradient 在 GSM8K 上同样单调递增（QW: 0.039→0.158→1.100→2.092; DS: 0.241→0.740→1.992→4.682），但 strategy specificity（importance/random gradient ratio）从 MATH-500 的 15-36× 衰减至 GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8×。注意：\"反转\"仅在原始 II_low 值上（random > importance），phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random。Strategy specificity 的 task-dependence 机制是开放问题（见 §6 Discussion）。这一发现挑战了 compound degradation 均匀分布的隐含假设。\n\n**数字基准**：所有数字基于 bf16 per-problem paired 统计量（B=10000 bootstrap）。median_diff 定义为 median(II_low_i − II_high_i)（逐 problem 配对差的中位数）。fp16 旧数据已弃用。\n\n## Narrative Arc\n\nCompound sparsity 是高效 LLM 推理的实用部署需求，但 prior work（SparK, Ada-KV, SLiM）将 compound interaction 视为均匀超可加。我们发现 severity 是 strategy × phase 交互的涌现属性：importance eviction 的 compound interaction 在 low-sparsity phase 远大于 high-sparsity phase（paired median difference 单调递增 0.39→8.48），而 random eviction 在低 sparsity (s015/s020) NS，在 s025+ 跨模型显著但效应量远小于 importance (2.7-15×)——存在 sparsity threshold (~s020-s025)，低于阈值 compound effect importance-specific，高于阈值两者均触发但 importance 主导。Cross-model replication 方向一致（Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek，onset threshold s≥0.20）。LLaMA 跨架构验证已完成（c3_llama, D060）：qualitative direction consistent（importance phase gradient d_z≈1.0），但 imp_vs_rand 交互弱（d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 显著），且 random 也显示非平凡 phase gradient（d_z 0.35→0.44），strategy-dependence 强度 architecture-dependent。我们通过 discrimination collapse 机制解释这一现象：head pruning → importance score 的判别力崩塌（Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致）→ importance eviction 退化为有偏伪随机。Attention entropy redistribution 作为 model-dependent secondary effect 在 DeepSeek 上观察到，但在 Qwen 上不稳健（D044）。\n\n**Framing 硬约束（D015）**：\n- MUST: \\\\\\\"emergent phase-strategy interaction\\\\\\\"\n- MUST NOT: \\\\\\\"importance metric limitation / importance is broken\\\\\\\"\n- MUST NOT: claim \\\\\\\"importance masking produces super-additive interaction\\\\\\\" without qualifier — random masking also produces positive II, and at s025+ random is statistically significant (D063). The distinguishing signal is **magnitude gradient** (importance 2.7-15× larger) and **onset threshold** (random NS below ~s020, importance significant from s015+), not the existence of super-additivity itself (D023)\n\n## Core Claims\n\n| ID | Claim | Status | Key Evidence |\n|----|-------|--------|-------------|\n| C1 | Compound sparsity severity is strategy- and task-modulated | confirmed | MATH-500: importance gradient 15-36× random; GSM8K: ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。Phase gradient 层面 importance ≥ random 跨 benchmark 成立，但 magnitude ratio task-dependent。Threshold ~s020-s025 (D063) |\n| C2 | Severity is phase-modulated (amplified in low-sparsity phase) | confirmed | bf16 paired median difference 单调递增: 0.39→1.21→3.99→8.48; Bonferroni p<0.005 全 4 水平 (D032)。预注册：n=500 后若 QW s015 CI 仍跨零，叙事改为 'compound effect emerges above threshold sparsity (~s020)' |\n| C3 | Phase-strategy crossover exists | confirmed | s=0.25: importance high_phase=0.032 < random=0.818, importance low_phase=7.196 > random=1.363 (bf16) |\n| C4 | Discrimination collapse as primary mechanism; entropy redistribution model-dependent | partially_confirmed | D044: Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致; entropy collapse DeepSeek 一致但 Qwen s025 反转(+0.045) s030≈0。30/30 problems completed. |\n| C5 | Phase-modulated compound severity generalizes across models | confirmed | DeepSeek + Qwen cross-model replication: 方向一致, Cohen's d ρ=1.0, gradient permutation p=0.043. Qwen magnitude ~1/4 of DeepSeek, onset threshold s≥0.20 (S3→C). |\n| C5b | Phase-aware mitigation recovers compound degradation | future_work | D056: pilot 完成 gate_failed。Oracle recovery 18% < 30% gate (Wilcoxon p=0.002)，heuristic 32% 但 CI 跨零。方向正确但效应量不足，需更精细 phase boundary estimation → future work |\n| C6 | Severity gradient is sub-exponential | confirmed | Growth rate decreasing: Δ增长因子 3.8×→4.8×→2.0×（递减） |\n| C7 | Statistical power at n=500 confirms dose-response | confirmed | c2_n500_deepseek (success) + c2_qw_n500_r3 (success): 两模型 n=500 全 4 sparsity Bonferroni p<0.005, Spearman ρ=1.0 |\n| C8 | Cross-architecture validation (LLaMA) | partially_confirmed | D060: within-importance phase gradient 强(d_z~1.0) ✓，但 imp_vs_rand 交互弱(d_z 0.19→0.34, 仅 s030 Bonferroni p=0.029 显著)。**关键**：random 在 LLaMA 上也显示显著 phase gradient(d_z 0.35→0.44, CI 排除零)，与 DeepSeek/Qwen random 低 sparsity NS 模式定性不同。Qualitative direction consistent, quantitative strategy×phase interaction weaker + architecture-dependent。论文禁用 \"confirms\"，改用 \"suggests\"/\"provides partial support\"。 |\n| C9 | Differentiation from Lethe/SparK prior work | planned | Related Work §2 引用区分 + SparK gap analysis |\n| S3→C | Onset threshold is model-dependent (DeepSeek s≥0.15, Qwen s≥0.20) | confirmed | D037/D038: Qwen s015 d_z=0.37 CI含0, s020+ 显著 |\n| C10 | Phase gradient cross-benchmark robust; strategy specificity task-modulated | confirmed | GSM8K DS gradient 0.241→4.682 单调递增; QW gradient 0.039→2.092; imp/rand ratio 衰减至 2.3-3.8× (D075)。QW random s025+s030 均 success |\n| S7→C | Dose-response monotonicity (Spearman ρ=1.0) | confirmed | D047: 6-point dose-response, 单调递增 |\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### RC1: Generalizability — 7B models only, benchmark scope\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"Results on two 7B models and MATH-500 only. How do we know this generalizes to larger models or other reasoning tasks?\\\"\n- **应对**: 四层泛化证据：(1) Cross-model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B + Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct（同架构不同训练，ρ=1.0）(2) Cross-architecture: c3_llama (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B, LlamaForCausalLM)，qualitative direction consistent，但需加限定——LLaMA 上 random 也显示 phase gradient，strategy × phase 交互弱于 Qwen2 架构（D060）(3) **Cross-benchmark (D075)**: GSM8K（两模型）phase gradient 单调递增复现（DS: 0.241→4.682; QW: 0.039→2.092），但 strategy specificity ratio 从 MATH-500 15-36× 衰减至 2.3-3.8×，表明 phase modulation 跨 benchmark 稳健而 magnitude modulation task-dependent。Limitations 诚实声明：(a) 7B scale only；(b) strategy specificity 强度 task-dependent（GSM8K 衰减，可能因推理链更短）；(c) LLaMA 跨架构验证 n=50 限制功效；(d) random phase gradient 行为 architecture-dependent。\n- **实验支撑**: C5 (cross-model) + C8 (c3_llama cross-architecture) + C10 (cross-benchmark GSM8K, D075)\n\n### RC2: Mechanism — entropy-discrimination collapse 缺乏直接测量\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"The mechanism is conceptual. Where is the empirical evidence for entropy increase and discrimination collapse?\\\"\n- **应对**: c4_entropy 实验已完成（DeepSeek 30/30 + Qwen 30/30）。D044 结论：Gini/CV 下降跨模型一致（discrimination collapse confirmed）；entropy redistribution 在 DeepSeek 上一致但在 Qwen 上 s025 方向反转、s030 近零（model-dependent）。论文以 discrimination collapse 为主线，entropy 作 DeepSeek 特有的强化因素。\n- **实验支撑**: c4_entropy (DeepSeek DONE) + qwen_c4_entropy (DONE, negative for entropy universality)\n\n### RC3: Practical impact — 没有 throughput 数据\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"No wall-clock or throughput measurements. Is the severity amplification reflected in actual inference speed?\\\"\n- **应对**: 本文定位是 empirical finding paper（发现 + 机制解释），不是 method paper。Throughput 不是 claim 的一部分。Discussion 中明确 phase-gated controller 作为 future direction。\n  - C5b pilot 已完成（D056）：oracle recovery 18%（Wilcoxon p=0.002），heuristic recovery 32%（p=0.024），但两者 95% CI 均跨零。方向正确（Wilcoxon 显著）但效应量不足（未达 30% gate），需更精细的 phase boundary estimation。论文 §6 Discussion 诚实报告 pilot 结果 + future work。\n  - Heuristic > oracle 悖论值得提及：token position ratio 粗粒度划分可能恰好更适合 mitigation 场景，暗示 phase boundary 的最优粒度是开放问题。\n- **实验支撑**: c5b_pilot (gate_failed, D056)\n\n### RC4: Statistical rigor — bootstrap 是否足够\n- **预期质疑**: \\\"Per-problem bootstrap with 50 problems — sufficient sample size?\\\"\n- **应对**: bf16 使用 B=10000 per-problem paired bootstrap，有效配对数 n=49 (DeepSeek) / n=46 (Qwen)；n=500 实验进一步验证 (C7 running)。Permutation test 使用 paired median difference 作为 robust statistic（D032），Bonferroni 校正后全 4 水平 p<0.005。Dose-response 主用 Wilcoxon signed-rank p + median_diff（robust to outliers），Cohen's d 作为辅助效应量（DeepSeek 0.61→1.13, Qwen 0.37→1.44, registry cohens_d s015→s030），注释高 sparsity 下 d 受 outlier-driven variance 影响（DS s020→s025: median 3.3× jump 但 d 非单调，因极端 II 值影响分母，D064）。可在 appendix 补充 per-problem 分布图（已生成 fig4_per_problem_dist.pdf）。\n- **实验支撑**: bf16 permutation test (D032) + Cohen's d per-problem paired (rebootstrap B=10000) + n=500 Wilcoxon (C7 running)\n\n### RC5: Novelty — prior work 是否已覆盖 phase-dependent sparsity\n- **预期质疑**: \"ThinKV and phase-aware methods already consider phase. What's new?\"\n- **应对**: Prior work 在单轴上分析 phase（ThinKV: phase-aware eviction）或 compound（SparK: joint compression）。没有工作同时分析 compound × phase × strategy 的三维交互。Crossover 现象（同一 strategy 在不同 phase 方向反转）是全新发现。Related Work 加 Lethe 引用区分 + SparK 对比。具体区分：\n  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025): 在 KV cache 单轴上做 phase-aware 压缩（按 CoT 阶段差异化 eviction），但不涉及 pruning × eviction 的 compound interaction。我们研究的是双轴（head pruning × KV eviction）compound interaction 如何随 phase 变化，ThinKV 的单轴 phase-aware 策略是我们分析维度的子集。\n  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026): 揭示了单轴 KV 压缩的 phase transition 和 representational rigidity，是机制层面最接近的工作。关键区分：他们刻画的是单一压缩轴上压缩率的 critical threshold（phase transition），我们刻画的是两种压缩方法的 compound interaction severity 如何被 reasoning phase 调制（phase-dependent gradient）——维度正交。\n  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025): 发现 importance score collapse 并提出 entropy 补偿，为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供独立 supporting evidence——他们在单轴上观察到的 score collapse 正是我们在 compound setting 中发现的 Gini/CV 下降的单轴对应。\n  - **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025): 针对 reasoning task 做 KV compression 优化，属于 task-specific method。我们不是提出新方法，而是 mechanistic 分析 compound interaction 的 phase-dependent 行为，二者目标不同（optimization vs understanding）。\n- **实验支撑**: C3 (crossover), Related Work §2 的 gap 分析\n\n### RC6: Novelty vs Lethe/SparK\n- **预期质疑**: \"How does this differ from Lethe (AAAI 2026) which also does layer-time-adaptive KV pruning, or SparK which studies compound compression?\"\n- **应对**: Lethe 和 SparK 都没有分析 phase × strategy 的交互效应。Lethe 是 method paper（提出 adaptive eviction 方法），我们是 empirical finding paper（发现 phase-dependent severity gradient）。SparK 研究 compound compression 但将 interaction 视为均匀超可加，我们发现 interaction severity 随 phase 和 strategy 变化。新近工作进一步确认我们的独特定位：\n  - **Physics of KV Cache Compression** (arxiv 2603.01426, Mar 2026) 是最近的相关工作，研究单轴压缩的 phase transition 阈值行为。与我们的核心区别：他们的 phase transition 是压缩率维度上的 critical point，我们的 phase-dependent gradient 是 reasoning phase 维度上 compound interaction 的连续调制——两者刻画的 \"phase\" 语义不同（compression-rate phase vs reasoning phase）。\n  - **ThinKV** (arxiv 2510.01290, Oct 2025) 和 **R-KV** (arxiv 2505.24133, May 2025) 都在 KV compression 单轴上引入 phase/reasoning awareness，但均未涉及 compound interaction。我们的贡献在于揭示 pruning × eviction 双轴交互如何被 reasoning phase 调制，这是单轴方法无法观察到的涌现现象。\n  - **HIES** (arxiv 2510.13832, Oct 2025) 的 importance score collapse 发现为我们的 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证，但 HIES 聚焦于单轴补偿方法，未研究 collapse 在 compound setting 中的放大效应。\n  - Related Work §2 明确区分三者定位：Lethe/SparK = method/compound method, ThinKV/R-KV = single-axis phase-aware, Physics of KV = single-axis phase transition, HIES = single-axis collapse。我们 = compound × phase × strategy 三维交互分析。\n- **实验支撑**: 不需要额外实验，仅需 §2 引用区分\n\n## Paper Positioning\n\n**类型**: Empirical finding paper（非 method paper）\n**核心贡献**:\n1. 发现 compound sparsity severity 的 strategy × phase 交互\n2. 量化 severity gradient（bf16 paired median difference 0.39→8.48, Cohen's d 0.61→1.13）和 crossover 现象\n3. 提出 discrimination collapse 机制解释（Gini/CV 跨模型一致；entropy redistribution model-dependent）\n4. Cross-model + cross-architecture (LLaMA) replication 验证泛化性（三模型两架构；LLaMA partially_confirmed，strategy×phase 交互强度 architecture-dependent, D060）\n\n**投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR, deadline 2026-05-25\n**Rebuttal 准备**: Day 9 (2026-05-23) 预留 rebuttal letter 写作时间\n**关键时间线**：\n- Day 9 (2026-05-23): 预留写 rebuttal letter\n- Day 11 (2026-05-25): EMNLP 2026 ARR 截稿\n","numLines":94,"startLine":1,"totalLines":94}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013Mmmi1mKkpZRuyy4tWmeLj","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-8B n=250 cross-architecture replication: 8 conditions (imp+rand × 4 sparsities)\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_problems\": 250,\n7\t      \"n_valid\": 247,\n8\t      \"conditions_completed\": \"8/8\",\n9\t      \"n_bootstrap\": 10000,\n10\t      \"bonferroni_k\": 4,\n11\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz\": {\n12\t        \"s015\": 0.11,\n13\t        \"s020\": 0.14,\n14\t        \"s025\": 0.18,\n15\t        \"s030\": 0.22\n16\t      },\n17\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_ci\": {\n18\t        \"s015\": [\n19\t          -0.04,\n20\t          0.27\n21\t        ],\n22\t        \"s020\": [\n23\t          -0.02,\n24\t          0.3\n25\t        ],\n26\t        \"s025\": [\n27\t          0.02,\n28\t          0.35\n29\t        ],\n30\t        \"s030\": [\n31\t          0.05,\n32\t          0.39\n33\t        ]\n34\t      },\n35\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation\": {\n36\t        \"s015\": \"negligible\",\n37\t        \"s020\": \"negligible\",\n38\t        \"s025\": \"negligible\",\n39\t        \"s030\": \"small\"\n40\t      },\n41\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic\": true,\n42\t      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz\": {\n43\t        \"s015\": 0.92,\n44\t        \"s020\": 1.01,\n45\t        \"s025\": 1.05,\n46\t        \"s030\": 0.97\n47\t      },\n48\t      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci\": {\n49\t        \"s015\": [\n50\t          0.68,\n51\t          1.18\n52\t        ],\n53\t        \"s020\": [\n54\t          0.78,\n55\t          1.25\n56\t        ],\n57\t        \"s025\": [\n58\t          0.82,\n59\t          1.3\n60\t        ],\n61\t        \"s030\": [\n62\t          0.74,\n63\t          1.22\n64\t        ]\n65\t      },\n66\t      \"phase_gradient_importance_interpretation\": \"all_large\",\n67\t      \"phase_gradient_random_dz\": {\n68\t        \"s015\": 0.52,\n69\t        \"s020\": 0.58,\n70\t        \"s025\": 0.65,\n71\t        \"s030\": 0.72\n72\t      },\n73\t      \"phase_gradient_random_dz_ci\": {\n74\t        \"s015\": [\n75\t          0.31,\n76\t          0.74\n77\t        ],\n78\t        \"s020\": [\n79\t          0.37,\n80\t          0.8\n81\t        ],\n82\t        \"s025\": [\n83\t          0.44,\n84\t          0.87\n85\t        ],\n86\t        \"s030\": [\n87\t          0.51,\n88\t          0.93\n89\t        ]\n90\t      },\n91\t      \"phase_gradient_random_interpretation\": \"all_medium\",\n92\t      \"median_diff_imp_vs_rand\": {\n93\t        \"s015\": 0.012,\n94\t        \"s020\": 0.018,\n95\t        \"s025\": 0.045,\n96\t        \"s030\": 0.098\n97\t      },\n98\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": {\n99\t        \"s015\": 0.21,\n100\t        \"s020\": 0.14,\n101\t        \"s025\": 0.08,\n102\t        \"s030\": 0.04\n103\t      },\n104\t      \"wilcoxon_p_bonferroni\": {\n105\t        \"s015\": 0.84,\n106\t        \"s020\": 0.56,\n107\t        \"s025\": 0.32,\n108\t        \"s030\": 0.16\n109\t      },\n110\t      \"significant_bonferroni\": {\n111\t        \"s015\": false,\n112\t        \"s020\": false,\n113\t        \"s025\": false,\n114\t        \"s030\": false\n115\t      },\n116\t      \"dose_response_importance_monotonic\": true,\n117\t      \"dose_response_importance_spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n118\t      \"dose_response_random_monotonic\": true,\n119\t      \"dose_response_random_spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n120\t      \"imp_rand_ratio_median_gradient\": \"1.3-1.8x\"\n121\t    },\n122\t    \"tables\": [\n123\t      {\n124\t        \"title\": \"Table: LLaMA n=250 Phase Gradient Comparison (worst tier)\",\n125\t        \"columns\": [\n126\t          \"Sparsity\",\n127\t          \"Imp d_z\",\n128\t          \"Rand d_z\",\n129\t          \"Imp-Rand d_z\",\n130\t          \"Bonf. sig?\"\n131\t        ],\n132\t        \"rows\": [\n133\t          [\n134\t            \"s015\",\n135\t            \"0.92\",\n136\t            \"0.52\",\n137\t            \"0.11\",\n138\t            \"No\"\n139\t          ],\n140\t          [\n141\t            \"s020\",\n142\t            \"1.01\",\n143\t            \"0.58\",\n144\t            \"0.14\",\n145\t            \"No\"\n146\t          ],\n147\t          [\n148\t            \"s025\",\n149\t            \"1.05\",\n150\t            \"0.65\",\n151\t            \"0.18\",\n152\t            \"No\"\n153\t          ],\n154\t          [\n155\t            \"s030\",\n156\t            \"0.97\",\n157\t            \"0.72\",\n158\t            \"0.22\",\n159\t            \"No\"\n160\t          ]\n161\t        ]\n162\t      }\n163\t    ],\n164\t    \"figures\": [],\n165\t    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA n=250数据定性确认了n=50的发现但更精确：(1) within-importance phase gradient依然large（d_z≈1.0），\\n确认phase-dependent compound amplification是跨架构的；(2) 但random phase gradient也是medium（d_z≈0.6），\\n且imp_vs_rand差异全部Bonferroni NS。这强力支持worst-tier叙事：phase modulation是universal的，\\nstrategy specificity不是。对论文影响：C8必须从\\\"partially confirmed\\\"降级为\\\"direction consistent only\\\"，\\n且明确陈述\\\"strategy×phase interaction strength is architecture-dependent and not reliably detected \\non LLaMA even at n=250\\\"。\\n\\n\\nn=250提供了比n=50高得多的统计功效（可检测d≈0.18的效应），但即使如此imp_vs_rand d_z仍然<0.25。\\n这意味着LLaMA上importance与random之间的真实效应量确实极小——n=50时观察到的d_z 0.19-0.34部分是\\n噪声驱动的高估（regression to the mean）。增加样本量后估计值收缩到0.11-0.22。\\n关键发现：random phase gradient d_z在0.52-0.72范围，是medium效应量，与n=50数据（0.35-0.44）\\n方向一致但更精确。这意味着在LLaMA架构上，compound sparsity的phase-dependent amplification\\n是一个普遍现象，不依赖于eviction strategy。机制解释：LLaMA的GQA（Grouped Query Attention）\\n结构导致head pruning后剩余heads的attention distribution变化对所有eviction strategy产生\\n类似的phase-dependent degradation——information-dense reasoning phases无论用什么strategy\\n剔除KV cache都会受到更大的compound损伤。Bonferroni校正后0/4显著，确认strategy×phase\\ninteraction在LLaMA上不是可靠发现。\\n\"\n166\t  },\n167\t  {\n168\t    \"name\": \"c8_llama_gpu0_s025\",\n169\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA s025单条件加速跑（GPU0 preemptive），为n=250提供partial early results\",\n170\t    \"results\": {\n171\t      \"n_problems\": 250,\n172\t      \"condition\": \"importance_s025\",\n173\t      \"phase_gradient_dz\": 1.05,\n174\t      \"phase_gradient_dz_ci\": [\n175\t        0.82,\n176\t        1.3\n177\t      ],\n178\t      \"median_ii_low\": 2.85,\n179\t      \"median_ii_high\": 0.42,\n180\t      \"median_diff\": 2.43,\n181\t      \"median_diff_ci\": [\n182\t        1.65,\n183\t        3.28\n184\t      ],\n185\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 1.2e-18,\n186\t      \"interpretation\": \"strong within-importance phase gradient confirmed\"\n187\t    },\n188\t    \"tables\": [],\n189\t    \"figures\": [],\n190\t    \"analysis\": \"GPU0加速结果单独看是\\\"positive\\\"（importance gradient strong），但在worst tier下这不是\\ndifferentiating evidence——因为random条件也会显示medium gradient。此数据的主要价值是\\n确认LLaMA n=250实验的pipeline功能正常。\\n\\n\\n这是c8_llama_n250_fixed的子集数据（仅importance s025条件），在GPU0上提前跑以获得early signal。\\n在worst tier下，within-importance gradient仍然strong（d_z≈1.05），因为phase modulation本身\\n是universal的——问题不在于importance是否有phase gradient，而在于random是否也有。\\n单独看importance s025的数据会让人误以为结果很好，但需要等random条件完成才能评估strategy specificity。\\n\"\n191\t  },\n192\t  {\n193\t    \"name\": \"c10_lang_s020_s025\",\n194\t    \"description\": \"DS MATH-500 language switching analysis at intermediate sparsities s020/s025\",\n195\t    \"results\": {\n196\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n197\t      \"s020\": {\n198\t        \"switch_rate\": 0.12,\n199\t        \"cn_count\": 6,\n200\t        \"en_count\": 44,\n201\t        \"cn_acc\": 0.0,\n202\t        \"en_acc\": 0.3,\n203\t        \"avg_cn_token_ratio\": 0.35\n204\t      },\n205\t      \"s025\": {\n206\t        \"switch_rate\": 0.26,\n207\t        \"cn_count\": 13,\n208\t        \"en_count\": 37,\n209\t        \"cn_acc\": 0.08,\n210\t        \"en_acc\": 0.08,\n211\t        \"avg_cn_token_ratio\": 0.52\n212\t      },\n213\t      \"trend_full\": \"0% (dense) → 4% (s015) → 12% (s020) → 26% (s025) → 40% (s030)\",\n214\t      \"monotonic\": true\n215\t    },\n216\t    \"tables\": [\n217\t      {\n218\t        \"title\": \"Table: Language Switching Dose-Response (DS, MATH-500)\",\n219\t        \"columns\": [\n220\t          \"Sparsity\",\n221\t          \"Switch Rate\",\n222\t          \"CN Count\",\n223\t          \"EN Acc\",\n224\t          \"CN Acc\"\n225\t        ],\n226\t        \"rows\": [\n227\t          [\n228\t            \"dense\",\n229\t            \"0%\",\n230\t            \"0\",\n231\t            \"0.52\",\n232\t            \"—\"\n233\t          ],\n234\t          [\n235\t            \"s015\",\n236\t            \"4%\",\n237\t            \"2\",\n238\t            \"0.375\",\n239\t            \"0.0\"\n240\t          ],\n241\t          [\n242\t            \"s020\",\n243\t            \"12%\",\n244\t            \"6\",\n245\t            \"0.30\",\n246\t            \"0.0\"\n247\t          ],\n248\t          [\n249\t            \"s025\",\n250\t            \"26%\",\n251\t            \"13\",\n252\t            \"0.08\",\n253\t            \"0.08\"\n254\t          ],\n255\t          [\n256\t            \"s030\",\n257\t            \"40%\",\n258\t            \"20\",\n259\t            \"0.10\",\n260\t            \"0.10\"\n261\t          ]\n262\t        ]\n263\t      }\n264\t    ],\n265\t    \"figures\": [],\n266\t    \"analysis\": \"Language switching数据在worst tier下完全可用——它支持C2（phase-modulated severity）和C6\\n（sub-exponential growth），不依赖strategy specificity。可在论文§5 Discussion中作为\\ncompound degradation的qualitative behavioral evidence，补充perplexity-based II metric。\\n\\n\\nLanguage switching是compound degradation的一个行为层面的表现——当compound sparsity足够高时，\\nDeepSeek-R1-Distill（原始训练数据含中文）会退化到中文推理。这个现象在worst tier下不受影响，\\n因为它不涉及strategy specificity问题——它只是compound severity递增的behavioral correlate。\\ns020（12%）和s025（26%）填充了s015（4%）到s030（40%）之间的dose-response曲线。\\nmonotonic递增与II median_diff的dose-response一致。在worst tier下，这个实验的结论不变：\\ncompound sparsity severity递增导致behavioral degradation（包括language switching）递增。\\n但它不能用来支持strategy specificity claim——它只用了importance条件。\\n\"\n267\t  },\n268\t  {\n269\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\",\n270\t    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond benchmark: DS importance s015 pilot — 测试非数学推理的phase gradient\",\n271\t    \"results\": {\n272\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n273\t      \"benchmark\": \"GPQA Diamond\",\n274\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n275\t      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n276\t      \"sparsity\": 0.15,\n277\t      \"phase_gradient_median_diff\": 0.18,\n278\t      \"phase_gradient_ci\": [\n279\t        0.04,\n280\t        0.35\n281\t      ],\n282\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.012,\n283\t      \"ii_high_median\": 0.008,\n284\t      \"ii_mid_median\": 0.052,\n285\t      \"ii_low_median\": 0.19,\n286\t      \"phase_distribution\": {\n287\t        \"high_tokens\": 8500,\n288\t        \"mid_tokens\": 12000,\n289\t        \"low_tokens\": 18500\n290\t      },\n291\t      \"dense_accuracy\": 0.38,\n292\t      \"s015_accuracy\": 0.32\n293\t    },\n294\t    \"tables\": [\n295\t      {\n296\t        \"title\": \"Table: GPQA vs MATH-500 Phase Gradient Comparison (DS, s015, importance)\",\n297\t        \"columns\": [\n298\t          \"Benchmark\",\n299\t          \"median_diff\",\n300\t          \"II_low\",\n301\t          \"II_high\",\n302\t          \"ratio (low/high)\"\n303\t        ],\n304\t        \"rows\": [\n305\t          [\n306\t            \"MATH-500\",\n307\t            \"0.39\",\n308\t            \"0.398\",\n309\t            \"0.006\",\n310\t            \"66×\"\n311\t          ],\n312\t          [\n313\t            \"GPQA Diamond\",\n314\t            \"0.18\",\n315\t            \"0.190\",\n316\t            \"0.008\",\n317\t            \"24×\"\n318\t          ]\n319\t        ]\n320\t      }\n321\t    ],\n322\t    \"figures\": [],\n323\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA pilot确认phase modulation的跨benchmark泛化（C10方向），但效应量缩减暗示在该benchmark上\\nstrategy specificity将更弱。这是worst tier的关键预测：跨benchmark时phase gradient universal\\n但strategy specificity shrinks。论文需要在§6 Discussion诚实报告：\\\"Phase modulation generalizes\\nto non-mathematical reasoning, but strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent.\\\"\\n\\n\\nGPQA Diamond是研究生级别的科学推理题，推理链通常比MATH-500更长且更复杂。在worst tier下：\\n(1) Phase gradient仍然存在（median_diff=0.18, p=0.012显著），确认phase modulation在\\n非数学benchmark上成立；(2) 但效应量远小于MATH-500同条件（DS s015 MATH-500 median_diff=0.39，\\nGPQA只有0.18，约为一半）。这本身不构成worst tier的核心打击——真正的问题是当后续跑random条件时，\\nGPQA上importance/random ratio会<2×。s015是pilot，效应量已经小意味着在更高sparsity下\\n即使importance gradient增大，random也会同步增大，导致ratio始终在1.0-1.9×范围。\\n原因：GPQA的推理链更distributed、attention pattern更uniform，导致importance score的\\ndiscrimination本身就比MATH-500弱——即head pruning后的Gini collapse更严重，\\nimportance eviction更快退化为pseudo-random。\\n\"\n324\t  },\n325\t  {\n326\t    \"name\": \"gpqa_full_battery\",\n327\t    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond full: DS+QW × importance × 4 sparsities + 2 random controls = 10 runs\",\n328\t    \"results\": {\n329\t      \"ds_importance\": {\n330\t        \"s015\": {\n331\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.18,\n332\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.012\n333\t        },\n334\t        \"s020\": {\n335\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.52,\n336\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.003\n337\t        },\n338\t        \"s025\": {\n339\t          \"median_gradient\": 1.35,\n340\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0002\n341\t        },\n342\t        \"s030\": {\n343\t          \"median_gradient\": 2.89,\n344\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001\n345\t        }\n346\t      },\n347\t      \"ds_random\": {\n348\t        \"s025\": {\n349\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.92,\n350\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.008\n351\t        },\n352\t        \"s030\": {\n353\t          \"median_gradient\": 1.85,\n354\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.003\n355\t        }\n356\t      },\n357\t      \"qw_importance\": {\n358\t        \"s015\": {\n359\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.02,\n360\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.31\n361\t        },\n362\t        \"s020\": {\n363\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.11,\n364\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.045\n365\t        },\n366\t        \"s025\": {\n367\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.58,\n368\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.001\n369\t        },\n370\t        \"s030\": {\n371\t          \"median_gradient\": 1.42,\n372\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0003\n373\t        }\n374\t      },\n375\t      \"qw_random\": {\n376\t        \"s025\": {\n377\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.41,\n378\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.02\n379\t        },\n380\t        \"s030\": {\n381\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.95,\n382\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.006\n383\t        }\n384\t      },\n385\t      \"strategy_specificity_ratio\": {\n386\t        \"ds_s025\": 1.47,\n387\t        \"ds_s030\": 1.56,\n388\t        \"qw_s025\": 1.41,\n389\t        \"qw_s030\": 1.49\n390\t      },\n391\t      \"cross_benchmark_comparison\": {\n392\t        \"math500_ratio_range\": \"2.7-36×\",\n393\t        \"gsm8k_ratio_range\": \"2.3-3.8×\",\n394\t        \"gpqa_ratio_range\": \"1.4-1.6×\"\n395\t      },\n396\t      \"dose_response_monotonic_importance\": true,\n397\t      \"dose_response_monotonic_random\": true\n398\t    },\n399\t    \"tables\": [\n400\t      {\n401\t        \"title\": \"Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks (worst tier)\",\n402\t        \"columns\": [\n403\t          \"Benchmark\",\n404\t          \"Task Type\",\n405\t          \"DS ratio\",\n406\t          \"QW ratio\",\n407\t          \"Interpretation\"\n408\t        ],\n409\t        \"rows\": [\n410\t          [\n411\t            \"MATH-500\",\n412\t            \"Math reasoning\",\n413\t            \"15-36×\",\n414\t            \"2.7-20×\",\n415\t            \"Strong specificity\"\n416\t          ],\n417\t          [\n418\t            \"GSM8K\",\n419\t            \"Easy math\",\n420\t            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n421\t            \"~2×\",\n422\t            \"Weak specificity\"\n423\t          ],\n424\t          [\n425\t            \"GPQA Diamond\",\n426\t            \"Science reasoning\",\n427\t            \"1.5-1.6×\",\n428\t            \"1.4-1.5×\",\n429\t            \"No meaningful specificity\"\n430\t          ]\n431\t        ]\n432\t      }\n433\t    ],\n434\t    \"figures\": [],\n435\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA结果是worst tier的杀手锏：它表明strategy specificity不是compound sparsity的intrinsic property，\\n而是task-benchmark-specific artifact。Phase modulation remains robust（所有条件gradient单调），\\n但\\\"importance is special\\\"的claim被严重削弱。论文必须reframe：C1从\\\"strategy- and task-modulated\\\"\\n改为\\\"phase-modulated; strategy modulation limited to specific task-architecture combinations\\\"。\\nEMNLP submission仍可行但novelty pitch缩窄。\\n\\n\\nGPQA Diamond上strategy specificity ratio全面崩塌到<2×，这是worst tier的核心证据。原因链：\\n(1) GPQA推理更复杂→attention pattern更distributed→importance score baseline discrimination更低；\\n(2) Head pruning后Gini collapse更严重→importance eviction质量下降更多；\\n(3) 结果：importance和random eviction在GPQA上产生的compound interaction差异缩小到1.4-1.6×。\\n\\n注意：phase gradient本身对两种strategy都是单调递增的（importance和random都有dose-response），\\n这进一步支持worst tier的核心论点——phase modulation是universal的，strategy specificity不是。\\n\\n关键对比：MATH-500 ratio 15-36×（DS n=500）→ GSM8K 2.3-3.8× → GPQA 1.4-1.6×。\\n随着task complexity增加，strategy specificity单调递减。这暗示strategy specificity\\n主要是\\\"easy tasks with clear attention patterns\\\"的特有属性，不是compound sparsity的\\nfundamental property。论文的novelty pitch必须从三维交互降级。\\n\"\n436\t  },\n437\t  {\n438\t    \"name\": \"14b_scale_validation\",\n439\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct × MATH-500 × importance × 4 sparsities + 1 random control\",\n440\t    \"results\": {\n441\t      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n442\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n443\t      \"importance\": {\n444\t        \"s015\": {\n445\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.04,\n446\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.08\n447\t        },\n448\t        \"s020\": {\n449\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.19,\n450\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.005\n451\t        },\n452\t        \"s025\": {\n453\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.72,\n454\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0003\n455\t        },\n456\t        \"s030\": {\n457\t          \"median_gradient\": 1.85,\n458\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001\n459\t        }\n460\t      },\n461\t      \"random_s025\": {\n462\t        \"median_gradient\": 0.38,\n463\t        \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.015\n464\t      },\n465\t      \"strategy_specificity_ratio_s025\": 1.89,\n466\t      \"dose_response_monotonic\": true,\n467\t      \"dense_accuracy\": 0.58,\n468\t      \"s030_accuracy\": 0.28,\n469\t      \"cohens_d_range\": \"0.28-0.95\",\n470\t      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz\": {\n471\t        \"s015\": 0.45,\n472\t        \"s020\": 0.62,\n473\t        \"s025\": 0.78,\n474\t        \"s030\": 0.88\n475\t      }\n476\t    },\n477\t    \"tables\": [\n478\t      {\n479\t        \"title\": \"Table: 14B vs 7B Phase Gradient Comparison (importance, MATH-500)\",\n480\t        \"columns\": [\n481\t          \"Model\",\n482\t          \"s015\",\n483\t          \"s020\",\n484\t          \"s025\",\n485\t          \"s030\"\n486\t        ],\n487\t        \"rows\": [\n488\t          [\n489\t            \"DS-7B\",\n490\t            \"0.39\",\n491\t            \"1.21\",\n492\t            \"3.99\",\n493\t            \"8.48\"\n494\t          ],\n495\t          [\n496\t            \"QW-7B\",\n497\t            \"0.07\",\n498\t            \"0.31\",\n499\t            \"1.07\",\n500\t            \"3.16\"\n501\t          ],\n502\t          [\n503\t            \"QW-14B\",\n504\t            \"0.04\",\n505\t            \"0.19\",\n506\t            \"0.72\",\n507\t            \"1.85\"\n508\t          ]\n509\t        ]\n510\t      }\n511\t    ],\n512\t    \"figures\": [],\n513\t    \"analysis\": \"14B数据在worst tier下进一步削弱novelty：(1) Gradient magnitude随model scale递减，\\n暗示在64B/405B级production模型上效应可能negligible；(2) Strategy specificity仍然<2×。\\n论文Limitations需要：\\\" Our findings are strongest at 7B scale; the 14B pilot suggests\\neffect magnitude inversely correlates with model capacity, and production-scale models\\nmay exhibit substantially reduced compound vulnerability.\\\"\\n\\n\\n14B模型的redundancy更高（更多heads、更宽的attention），这意味着：\\n(1) 同样的pruning ratio对14B的相对影响更小→absolute gradient magnitude小于7B；\\n(2) 但phase modulation方向一致（gradient仍单调递增）；\\n(3) Strategy specificity ratio在14B上也<2×——因为14B有更多冗余heads，pruning后\\n剩余heads足以维持reasonable discrimination，导致importance和random的差异缩小。\\n\\nWorst tier解释：更大的模型有更多architectural redundancy，head pruning的marginal impact\\n被缓冲。这表明phase-modulated compound severity在small models上被放大（7B更susceptible），\\n而strategy specificity在任何model scale上都不robust。\\n\\n对论文影响：C5（cross-model generalization）方向confirmed但magnitude大幅缩减。\\n7B-only results不能直接外推到production-scale models。Limitations section必须诚实声明。\\n\"\n514\t  },\n515\t  {\n516\t    \"name\": \"c5_per_phase_gini_interaction\",\n517\t    \"description\": \"Gini collapse × II correlation analysis: 检验discrimination collapse是否差异化驱动strategy specificity\",\n518\t    \"results\": {\n519\t      \"ds_importance_gini_ii_correlation\": {\n520\t        \"s015\": 0.22,\n521\t        \"s020\": 0.28,\n522\t        \"s025\": 0.31,\n523\t        \"s030\": 0.35\n524\t      },\n525\t      \"ds_random_gini_ii_correlation\": {\n526\t        \"s015\": 0.18,\n527\t        \"s020\": 0.24,\n528\t        \"s025\": 0.27,\n529\t        \"s030\": 0.32\n530\t      },\n531\t      \"qw_importance_gini_ii_correlation\": {\n532\t        \"s015\": 0.12,\n533\t        \"s020\": 0.19,\n534\t        \"s025\": 0.25,\n535\t        \"s030\": 0.29\n536\t      },\n537\t      \"gini_delta_imp_vs_rand_ttest_p\": {\n538\t        \"ds_s015\": 0.82,\n539\t        \"ds_s020\": 0.65,\n540\t        \"ds_s025\": 0.41,\n541\t        \"ds_s030\": 0.28,\n542\t        \"qw_s015\": 0.91,\n543\t        \"qw_s020\": 0.73,\n544\t        \"qw_s025\": 0.55,\n545\t        \"qw_s030\": 0.38\n546\t      },\n547\t      \"overall_gini_interaction_correlation\": 0.26,\n548\t      \"imp_rand_gini_difference_significant\": false\n549\t    },\n550\t    \"tables\": [\n551\t      {\n552\t        \"title\": \"Table: Gini Delta (importance vs random) — No Significant Difference\",\n553\t        \"columns\": [\n554\t          \"Model\",\n555\t          \"Sparsity\",\n556\t          \"Imp Gini Δ\",\n557\t          \"Rand Gini Δ\",\n558\t          \"Difference\",\n559\t          \"p-value\"\n560\t        ],\n561\t        \"rows\": [\n562\t          [\n563\t            \"DS\",\n564\t            \"s015\",\n565\t            \"-0.030\",\n566\t            \"-0.031\",\n567\t            \"+0.001\",\n568\t            \"0.82\"\n569\t          ],\n570\t          [\n571\t            \"DS\",\n572\t            \"s020\",\n573\t            \"-0.040\",\n574\t            \"-0.040\",\n575\t            \"0.000\",\n576\t            \"0.65\"\n577\t          ],\n578\t          [\n579\t            \"DS\",\n580\t            \"s025\",\n581\t            \"-0.065\",\n582\t            \"-0.062\",\n583\t            \"-0.003\",\n584\t            \"0.41\"\n585\t          ],\n586\t          [\n587\t            \"DS\",\n588\t            \"s030\",\n589\t            \"-0.081\",\n590\t            \"-0.073\",\n591\t            \"-0.008\",\n592\t            \"0.28\"\n593\t          ],\n594\t          [\n595\t            \"QW\",\n596\t            \"s015\",\n597\t            \"-0.010\",\n598\t            \"-0.019\",\n599\t            \"+0.009\",\n600\t            \"0.91\"\n601\t          ],\n602\t          [\n603\t            \"QW\",\n604\t            \"s020\",\n605\t            \"-0.012\",\n606\t            \"-0.023\",\n607\t            \"+0.011\",\n608\t            \"0.73\"\n609\t          ],\n610\t          [\n611\t            \"QW\",\n612\t            \"s025\",\n613\t            \"-0.010\",\n614\t            \"-0.034\",\n615\t            \"+0.024\",\n616\t            \"0.55\"\n617\t          ],\n618\t          [\n619\t            \"QW\",\n620\t            \"s030\",\n621\t            \"-0.020\",\n622\t            \"-0.045\",\n623\t            \"+0.025\",\n624\t            \"0.38\"\n625\t          ]\n626\t        ]\n627\t      }\n628\t    ],\n629\t    \"figures\": [],\n630\t    \"analysis\": \"Mechanism evidence在worst tier下被削弱但不完全失败：discrimination collapse仍然是\\nphase-dependent compound amplification的合理机制（correlation存在），只是它不能解释\\n为什么importance会比random更严重——因为在多数条件下两者差异不显著。\\nC4需要reframe为：\\\"discrimination collapse explains phase-dependent amplification universally;\\nits strategy-selectivity is an architecture-specific secondary effect observed primarily in\\nDeepSeek on MATH-500\\\"。\\n\\n在worst tier下，Gini collapse在importance和random之间差异不显著（所有t-test p>0.28）。\\n两种strategy都导致discrimination collapse（Gini下降），importance只是多drop 0.01-0.02——\\n这在统计上不可区分（n=30 problems, per-phase 分析进一步降低effective n）。\\n\\nGini×II correlation存在但weak（r≈0.26），且importance和random的correlation pattern\\n几乎相同——这意味着discrimination collapse是head pruning的universal consequence，\\n不是importance-specific的。机制reframe：head pruning导致所有surviving heads的attention\\nscore distribution变得更uniform（Gini下降），这种uniform化在information-dense phases\\n影响更大（因为这些phases需要更selective的attention），导致compound interaction在low-sparsity\\nphases被放大——但这个amplification对任何eviction strategy都成立。\\n\\nCorrelation范围0.1-0.39对应worst tier的key metric range。\\n\"\n631\t  }\n632\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0d3a6356-38e1-41d0-9b56-a15a708917d3","uuid":"49bb8816-26e0-45f7-9611-ef3ba479f405","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:01:44.249Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073742/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-8B n=250 cross-architecture replication: 8 conditions (imp+rand × 4 sparsities)\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 250,\n      \"n_valid\": 247,\n      \"conditions_completed\": \"8/8\",\n      \"n_bootstrap\": 10000,\n      \"bonferroni_k\": 4,\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.11,\n        \"s020\": 0.14,\n        \"s025\": 0.18,\n        \"s030\": 0.22\n      },\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_ci\": {\n        \"s015\": [\n          -0.04,\n          0.27\n        ],\n        \"s020\": [\n          -0.02,\n          0.3\n        ],\n        \"s025\": [\n          0.02,\n          0.35\n        ],\n        \"s030\": [\n          0.05,\n          0.39\n        ]\n      },\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation\": {\n        \"s015\": \"negligible\",\n        \"s020\": \"negligible\",\n        \"s025\": \"negligible\",\n        \"s030\": \"small\"\n      },\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic\": true,\n      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.92,\n        \"s020\": 1.01,\n        \"s025\": 1.05,\n        \"s030\": 0.97\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci\": {\n        \"s015\": [\n          0.68,\n          1.18\n        ],\n        \"s020\": [\n          0.78,\n          1.25\n        ],\n        \"s025\": [\n          0.82,\n          1.3\n        ],\n        \"s030\": [\n          0.74,\n          1.22\n        ]\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_importance_interpretation\": \"all_large\",\n      \"phase_gradient_random_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.52,\n        \"s020\": 0.58,\n        \"s025\": 0.65,\n        \"s030\": 0.72\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_random_dz_ci\": {\n        \"s015\": [\n          0.31,\n          0.74\n        ],\n        \"s020\": [\n          0.37,\n          0.8\n        ],\n        \"s025\": [\n          0.44,\n          0.87\n        ],\n        \"s030\": [\n          0.51,\n          0.93\n        ]\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_random_interpretation\": \"all_medium\",\n      \"median_diff_imp_vs_rand\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.012,\n        \"s020\": 0.018,\n        \"s025\": 0.045,\n        \"s030\": 0.098\n      },\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.21,\n        \"s020\": 0.14,\n        \"s025\": 0.08,\n        \"s030\": 0.04\n      },\n      \"wilcoxon_p_bonferroni\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.84,\n        \"s020\": 0.56,\n        \"s025\": 0.32,\n        \"s030\": 0.16\n      },\n      \"significant_bonferroni\": {\n        \"s015\": false,\n        \"s020\": false,\n        \"s025\": false,\n        \"s030\": false\n      },\n      \"dose_response_importance_monotonic\": true,\n      \"dose_response_importance_spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n      \"dose_response_random_monotonic\": true,\n      \"dose_response_random_spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n      \"imp_rand_ratio_median_gradient\": \"1.3-1.8x\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: LLaMA n=250 Phase Gradient Comparison (worst tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Sparsity\",\n          \"Imp d_z\",\n          \"Rand d_z\",\n          \"Imp-Rand d_z\",\n          \"Bonf. sig?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            \"0.92\",\n            \"0.52\",\n            \"0.11\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            \"1.01\",\n            \"0.58\",\n            \"0.14\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            \"1.05\",\n            \"0.65\",\n            \"0.18\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            \"0.97\",\n            \"0.72\",\n            \"0.22\",\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA n=250数据定性确认了n=50的发现但更精确：(1) within-importance phase gradient依然large（d_z≈1.0），\\n确认phase-dependent compound amplification是跨架构的；(2) 但random phase gradient也是medium（d_z≈0.6），\\n且imp_vs_rand差异全部Bonferroni NS。这强力支持worst-tier叙事：phase modulation是universal的，\\nstrategy specificity不是。对论文影响：C8必须从\\\"partially confirmed\\\"降级为\\\"direction consistent only\\\"，\\n且明确陈述\\\"strategy×phase interaction strength is architecture-dependent and not reliably detected \\non LLaMA even at n=250\\\"。\\n\\n\\nn=250提供了比n=50高得多的统计功效（可检测d≈0.18的效应），但即使如此imp_vs_rand d_z仍然<0.25。\\n这意味着LLaMA上importance与random之间的真实效应量确实极小——n=50时观察到的d_z 0.19-0.34部分是\\n噪声驱动的高估（regression to the mean）。增加样本量后估计值收缩到0.11-0.22。\\n关键发现：random phase gradient d_z在0.52-0.72范围，是medium效应量，与n=50数据（0.35-0.44）\\n方向一致但更精确。这意味着在LLaMA架构上，compound sparsity的phase-dependent amplification\\n是一个普遍现象，不依赖于eviction strategy。机制解释：LLaMA的GQA（Grouped Query Attention）\\n结构导致head pruning后剩余heads的attention distribution变化对所有eviction strategy产生\\n类似的phase-dependent degradation——information-dense reasoning phases无论用什么strategy\\n剔除KV cache都会受到更大的compound损伤。Bonferroni校正后0/4显著，确认strategy×phase\\ninteraction在LLaMA上不是可靠发现。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c8_llama_gpu0_s025\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA s025单条件加速跑（GPU0 preemptive），为n=250提供partial early results\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 250,\n      \"condition\": \"importance_s025\",\n      \"phase_gradient_dz\": 1.05,\n      \"phase_gradient_dz_ci\": [\n        0.82,\n        1.3\n      ],\n      \"median_ii_low\": 2.85,\n      \"median_ii_high\": 0.42,\n      \"median_diff\": 2.43,\n      \"median_diff_ci\": [\n        1.65,\n        3.28\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 1.2e-18,\n      \"interpretation\": \"strong within-importance phase gradient confirmed\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPU0加速结果单独看是\\\"positive\\\"（importance gradient strong），但在worst tier下这不是\\ndifferentiating evidence——因为random条件也会显示medium gradient。此数据的主要价值是\\n确认LLaMA n=250实验的pipeline功能正常。\\n\\n\\n这是c8_llama_n250_fixed的子集数据（仅importance s025条件），在GPU0上提前跑以获得early signal。\\n在worst tier下，within-importance gradient仍然strong（d_z≈1.05），因为phase modulation本身\\n是universal的——问题不在于importance是否有phase gradient，而在于random是否也有。\\n单独看importance s025的数据会让人误以为结果很好，但需要等random条件完成才能评估strategy specificity。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c10_lang_s020_s025\",\n    \"description\": \"DS MATH-500 language switching analysis at intermediate sparsities s020/s025\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"s020\": {\n        \"switch_rate\": 0.12,\n        \"cn_count\": 6,\n        \"en_count\": 44,\n        \"cn_acc\": 0.0,\n        \"en_acc\": 0.3,\n        \"avg_cn_token_ratio\": 0.35\n      },\n      \"s025\": {\n        \"switch_rate\": 0.26,\n        \"cn_count\": 13,\n        \"en_count\": 37,\n        \"cn_acc\": 0.08,\n        \"en_acc\": 0.08,\n        \"avg_cn_token_ratio\": 0.52\n      },\n      \"trend_full\": \"0% (dense) → 4% (s015) → 12% (s020) → 26% (s025) → 40% (s030)\",\n      \"monotonic\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Language Switching Dose-Response (DS, MATH-500)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Sparsity\",\n          \"Switch Rate\",\n          \"CN Count\",\n          \"EN Acc\",\n          \"CN Acc\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"dense\",\n            \"0%\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"0.52\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            \"4%\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.375\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            \"12%\",\n            \"6\",\n            \"0.30\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            \"26%\",\n            \"13\",\n            \"0.08\",\n            \"0.08\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            \"40%\",\n            \"20\",\n            \"0.10\",\n            \"0.10\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Language switching数据在worst tier下完全可用——它支持C2（phase-modulated severity）和C6\\n（sub-exponential growth），不依赖strategy specificity。可在论文§5 Discussion中作为\\ncompound degradation的qualitative behavioral evidence，补充perplexity-based II metric。\\n\\n\\nLanguage switching是compound degradation的一个行为层面的表现——当compound sparsity足够高时，\\nDeepSeek-R1-Distill（原始训练数据含中文）会退化到中文推理。这个现象在worst tier下不受影响，\\n因为它不涉及strategy specificity问题——它只是compound severity递增的behavioral correlate。\\ns020（12%）和s025（26%）填充了s015（4%）到s030（40%）之间的dose-response曲线。\\nmonotonic递增与II median_diff的dose-response一致。在worst tier下，这个实验的结论不变：\\ncompound sparsity severity递增导致behavioral degradation（包括language switching）递增。\\n但它不能用来支持strategy specificity claim——它只用了importance条件。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond benchmark: DS importance s015 pilot — 测试非数学推理的phase gradient\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"benchmark\": \"GPQA Diamond\",\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n      \"strategy\": \"importance\",\n      \"sparsity\": 0.15,\n      \"phase_gradient_median_diff\": 0.18,\n      \"phase_gradient_ci\": [\n        0.04,\n        0.35\n      ],\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.012,\n      \"ii_high_median\": 0.008,\n      \"ii_mid_median\": 0.052,\n      \"ii_low_median\": 0.19,\n      \"phase_distribution\": {\n        \"high_tokens\": 8500,\n        \"mid_tokens\": 12000,\n        \"low_tokens\": 18500\n      },\n      \"dense_accuracy\": 0.38,\n      \"s015_accuracy\": 0.32\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: GPQA vs MATH-500 Phase Gradient Comparison (DS, s015, importance)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"median_diff\",\n          \"II_low\",\n          \"II_high\",\n          \"ratio (low/high)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"0.39\",\n            \"0.398\",\n            \"0.006\",\n            \"66×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA Diamond\",\n            \"0.18\",\n            \"0.190\",\n            \"0.008\",\n            \"24×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA pilot确认phase modulation的跨benchmark泛化（C10方向），但效应量缩减暗示在该benchmark上\\nstrategy specificity将更弱。这是worst tier的关键预测：跨benchmark时phase gradient universal\\n但strategy specificity shrinks。论文需要在§6 Discussion诚实报告：\\\"Phase modulation generalizes\\nto non-mathematical reasoning, but strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent.\\\"\\n\\n\\nGPQA Diamond是研究生级别的科学推理题，推理链通常比MATH-500更长且更复杂。在worst tier下：\\n(1) Phase gradient仍然存在（median_diff=0.18, p=0.012显著），确认phase modulation在\\n非数学benchmark上成立；(2) 但效应量远小于MATH-500同条件（DS s015 MATH-500 median_diff=0.39，\\nGPQA只有0.18，约为一半）。这本身不构成worst tier的核心打击——真正的问题是当后续跑random条件时，\\nGPQA上importance/random ratio会<2×。s015是pilot，效应量已经小意味着在更高sparsity下\\n即使importance gradient增大，random也会同步增大，导致ratio始终在1.0-1.9×范围。\\n原因：GPQA的推理链更distributed、attention pattern更uniform，导致importance score的\\ndiscrimination本身就比MATH-500弱——即head pruning后的Gini collapse更严重，\\nimportance eviction更快退化为pseudo-random。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gpqa_full_battery\",\n    \"description\": \"GPQA Diamond full: DS+QW × importance × 4 sparsities + 2 random controls = 10 runs\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ds_importance\": {\n        \"s015\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.18,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.012\n        },\n        \"s020\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.52,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.003\n        },\n        \"s025\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 1.35,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0002\n        },\n        \"s030\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 2.89,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001\n        }\n      },\n      \"ds_random\": {\n        \"s025\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.92,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.008\n        },\n        \"s030\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 1.85,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.003\n        }\n      },\n      \"qw_importance\": {\n        \"s015\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.02,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.31\n        },\n        \"s020\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.11,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.045\n        },\n        \"s025\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.58,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.001\n        },\n        \"s030\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 1.42,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0003\n        }\n      },\n      \"qw_random\": {\n        \"s025\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.41,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.02\n        },\n        \"s030\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.95,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.006\n        }\n      },\n      \"strategy_specificity_ratio\": {\n        \"ds_s025\": 1.47,\n        \"ds_s030\": 1.56,\n        \"qw_s025\": 1.41,\n        \"qw_s030\": 1.49\n      },\n      \"cross_benchmark_comparison\": {\n        \"math500_ratio_range\": \"2.7-36×\",\n        \"gsm8k_ratio_range\": \"2.3-3.8×\",\n        \"gpqa_ratio_range\": \"1.4-1.6×\"\n      },\n      \"dose_response_monotonic_importance\": true,\n      \"dose_response_monotonic_random\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks (worst tier)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"Task Type\",\n          \"DS ratio\",\n          \"QW ratio\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"Math reasoning\",\n            \"15-36×\",\n            \"2.7-20×\",\n            \"Strong specificity\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"Easy math\",\n            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n            \"~2×\",\n            \"Weak specificity\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA Diamond\",\n            \"Science reasoning\",\n            \"1.5-1.6×\",\n            \"1.4-1.5×\",\n            \"No meaningful specificity\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA结果是worst tier的杀手锏：它表明strategy specificity不是compound sparsity的intrinsic property，\\n而是task-benchmark-specific artifact。Phase modulation remains robust（所有条件gradient单调），\\n但\\\"importance is special\\\"的claim被严重削弱。论文必须reframe：C1从\\\"strategy- and task-modulated\\\"\\n改为\\\"phase-modulated; strategy modulation limited to specific task-architecture combinations\\\"。\\nEMNLP submission仍可行但novelty pitch缩窄。\\n\\n\\nGPQA Diamond上strategy specificity ratio全面崩塌到<2×，这是worst tier的核心证据。原因链：\\n(1) GPQA推理更复杂→attention pattern更distributed→importance score baseline discrimination更低；\\n(2) Head pruning后Gini collapse更严重→importance eviction质量下降更多；\\n(3) 结果：importance和random eviction在GPQA上产生的compound interaction差异缩小到1.4-1.6×。\\n\\n注意：phase gradient本身对两种strategy都是单调递增的（importance和random都有dose-response），\\n这进一步支持worst tier的核心论点——phase modulation是universal的，strategy specificity不是。\\n\\n关键对比：MATH-500 ratio 15-36×（DS n=500）→ GSM8K 2.3-3.8× → GPQA 1.4-1.6×。\\n随着task complexity增加，strategy specificity单调递减。这暗示strategy specificity\\n主要是\\\"easy tasks with clear attention patterns\\\"的特有属性，不是compound sparsity的\\nfundamental property。论文的novelty pitch必须从三维交互降级。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"14b_scale_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct × MATH-500 × importance × 4 sparsities + 1 random control\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"importance\": {\n        \"s015\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.04,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.08\n        },\n        \"s020\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.19,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.005\n        },\n        \"s025\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.72,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0003\n        },\n        \"s030\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 1.85,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001\n        }\n      },\n      \"random_s025\": {\n        \"median_gradient\": 0.38,\n        \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.015\n      },\n      \"strategy_specificity_ratio_s025\": 1.89,\n      \"dose_response_monotonic\": true,\n      \"dense_accuracy\": 0.58,\n      \"s030_accuracy\": 0.28,\n      \"cohens_d_range\": \"0.28-0.95\",\n      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.45,\n        \"s020\": 0.62,\n        \"s025\": 0.78,\n        \"s030\": 0.88\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: 14B vs 7B Phase Gradient Comparison (importance, MATH-500)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"s015\",\n          \"s020\",\n          \"s025\",\n          \"s030\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DS-7B\",\n            \"0.39\",\n            \"1.21\",\n            \"3.99\",\n            \"8.48\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QW-7B\",\n            \"0.07\",\n            \"0.31\",\n            \"1.07\",\n            \"3.16\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QW-14B\",\n            \"0.04\",\n            \"0.19\",\n            \"0.72\",\n            \"1.85\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"14B数据在worst tier下进一步削弱novelty：(1) Gradient magnitude随model scale递减，\\n暗示在64B/405B级production模型上效应可能negligible；(2) Strategy specificity仍然<2×。\\n论文Limitations需要：\\\" Our findings are strongest at 7B scale; the 14B pilot suggests\\neffect magnitude inversely correlates with model capacity, and production-scale models\\nmay exhibit substantially reduced compound vulnerability.\\\"\\n\\n\\n14B模型的redundancy更高（更多heads、更宽的attention），这意味着：\\n(1) 同样的pruning ratio对14B的相对影响更小→absolute gradient magnitude小于7B；\\n(2) 但phase modulation方向一致（gradient仍单调递增）；\\n(3) Strategy specificity ratio在14B上也<2×——因为14B有更多冗余heads，pruning后\\n剩余heads足以维持reasonable discrimination，导致importance和random的差异缩小。\\n\\nWorst tier解释：更大的模型有更多architectural redundancy，head pruning的marginal impact\\n被缓冲。这表明phase-modulated compound severity在small models上被放大（7B更susceptible），\\n而strategy specificity在任何model scale上都不robust。\\n\\n对论文影响：C5（cross-model generalization）方向confirmed但magnitude大幅缩减。\\n7B-only results不能直接外推到production-scale models。Limitations section必须诚实声明。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c5_per_phase_gini_interaction\",\n    \"description\": \"Gini collapse × II correlation analysis: 检验discrimination collapse是否差异化驱动strategy specificity\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ds_importance_gini_ii_correlation\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.22,\n        \"s020\": 0.28,\n        \"s025\": 0.31,\n        \"s030\": 0.35\n      },\n      \"ds_random_gini_ii_correlation\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.18,\n        \"s020\": 0.24,\n        \"s025\": 0.27,\n        \"s030\": 0.32\n      },\n      \"qw_importance_gini_ii_correlation\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.12,\n        \"s020\": 0.19,\n        \"s025\": 0.25,\n        \"s030\": 0.29\n      },\n      \"gini_delta_imp_vs_rand_ttest_p\": {\n        \"ds_s015\": 0.82,\n        \"ds_s020\": 0.65,\n        \"ds_s025\": 0.41,\n        \"ds_s030\": 0.28,\n        \"qw_s015\": 0.91,\n        \"qw_s020\": 0.73,\n        \"qw_s025\": 0.55,\n        \"qw_s030\": 0.38\n      },\n      \"overall_gini_interaction_correlation\": 0.26,\n      \"imp_rand_gini_difference_significant\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Gini Delta (importance vs random) — No Significant Difference\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Sparsity\",\n          \"Imp Gini Δ\",\n          \"Rand Gini Δ\",\n          \"Difference\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DS\",\n            \"s015\",\n            \"-0.030\",\n            \"-0.031\",\n            \"+0.001\",\n            \"0.82\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DS\",\n            \"s020\",\n            \"-0.040\",\n            \"-0.040\",\n            \"0.000\",\n            \"0.65\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DS\",\n            \"s025\",\n            \"-0.065\",\n            \"-0.062\",\n            \"-0.003\",\n            \"0.41\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DS\",\n            \"s030\",\n            \"-0.081\",\n            \"-0.073\",\n            \"-0.008\",\n            \"0.28\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QW\",\n            \"s015\",\n            \"-0.010\",\n            \"-0.019\",\n            \"+0.009\",\n            \"0.91\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QW\",\n            \"s020\",\n            \"-0.012\",\n            \"-0.023\",\n            \"+0.011\",\n            \"0.73\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QW\",\n            \"s025\",\n            \"-0.010\",\n            \"-0.034\",\n            \"+0.024\",\n            \"0.55\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QW\",\n            \"s030\",\n            \"-0.020\",\n            \"-0.045\",\n            \"+0.025\",\n            \"0.38\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mechanism evidence在worst tier下被削弱但不完全失败：discrimination collapse仍然是\\nphase-dependent compound amplification的合理机制（correlation存在），只是它不能解释\\n为什么importance会比random更严重——因为在多数条件下两者差异不显著。\\nC4需要reframe为：\\\"discrimination collapse explains phase-dependent amplification universally;\\nits strategy-selectivity is an architecture-specific secondary effect observed primarily in\\nDeepSeek on MATH-500\\\"。\\n\\n在worst tier下，Gini collapse在importance和random之间差异不显著（所有t-test p>0.28）。\\n两种strategy都导致discrimination collapse（Gini下降），importance只是多drop 0.01-0.02——\\n这在统计上不可区分（n=30 problems, per-phase 分析进一步降低effective n）。\\n\\nGini×II correlation存在但weak（r≈0.26），且importance和random的correlation pattern\\n几乎相同——这意味着discrimination collapse是head pruning的universal consequence，\\n不是importance-specific的。机制reframe：head pruning导致所有surviving heads的attention\\nscore distribution变得更uniform（Gini下降），这种uniform化在information-dense phases\\n影响更大（因为这些phases需要更selective的attention），导致compound interaction在low-sparsity\\nphases被放大——但这个amplification对任何eviction strategy都成立。\\n\\nCorrelation范围0.1-0.39对应worst tier的key metric range。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":632,"startLine":1,"totalLines":632}}}
